{"name":"Synallactida","hex":"#331133","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Synallactida","blocks":[{"text":"Synallactida is a rankless clade of sea cucumbers, but is referred to as an order. Taxa within Synallactida were previously classified in an order called Aspidochirotida, which was determined to be polyphyletic in 2017."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Three-Rowed_Sea_Cucumber.jpg/330px-Three-Rowed_Sea_Cucumber.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Synallactida"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Parastichopus_californicus.jpg/330px-Parastichopus_californicus.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/Parastichopus_californicus.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Parastichopus_californicus.jpg/330px-Parastichopus_californicus.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AParastichopus_californicus.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Australostichopus_mollis_P1222859.JPG/250px-Australostichopus_mollis_P1222859.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Australostichopus_mollis_P1222859.JPG/500px-Australostichopus_mollis_P1222859.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Australostichopus_mollis_P1222859.JPG/250px-Australostichopus_mollis_P1222859.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%